e  nation's leaders  to fuel insurrection trump has often  said that he uses social platforms to  bypass what he calls the fake news media  on twitter trump has 88.7 million  followers which makes him the sixth most  followed person on the social site  former president barack obama is first  with  128 million they are acting in the  smallest  possible way a criminal way to attack  the capital  occupy it and violate federal law in  full public view in pursuit of something  they consider to be lofty  in her statement michelle also described  her horror at watching the mob of people  at the capitol  they set up gallows they proudly waved  the traitorous flag of the confederacy  through the halls  they desecrated the center of american  government  she added that the far right-wing media  along with the president  were responsible for what happened the  day was a fulfillment of the wishes of  an infantile and  unpatriotic president who can't handle  the truth of his own failures  and the wreckage lays at the feet of a  party and media apparatus that gleefully  cheered him on knowing full well the  possibility of consequences like these  and the former flotus said in order for  our nation to heal  we each need to do our part quote to  reach out  to listen and to hold tight to the truth  and values that have always led this  country forward  it will be an uncomfortable sometimes  painful process  but if we enter into it with an honest  and unwavering love of our country  then maybe we can finally start to heal
 

